                <pb facs="0752" n="632" sameAs="frus:frus1905/pg632"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Minister Morgan to the Secretary of State.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">Telegram.—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >American Legation</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Seoul</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1905-11-28"
                                ><hi rendition="#italic">November 28,
                    1905</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>(Mr. Morgan reports that the legation property and archives have been delivered
                    to the American consul-general at Seoul, and that he has informed the Korean
                    minister for foreign affairs of his withdrawal from Korea.)</p>
            </div>
